a></nav></div></div>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <nav class=\"nav shell\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Nolan Kido home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NK</span><span>Nolan Kido</span></a>\n      <ul class=\"nav-links\"><li><a href=\"/technology/\">Technology</a></li><li><a href=\"/living-well/\">Living Well</a></li><li><a href=\"/poker/\">Poker</a></li><li><a href=\"/creative/\">Creative Work</a></li><li><a href=\"/about/\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact/\" aria-current=\"page\">Contact</a></li></ul>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n  \n  <main id=\"main\" class=\"ledger\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<nav class=\"search-breadcrumb shell\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Contact</span></li></ol></nav>\n    <section class=\"page-hero shell\"><p class=\"page-kicker\">Contact</p><h1 class=\"page-title\">Get in touch.</h1></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell editorial-grid\"><div class=\"section-meta\"><h2 class=\"section-label\">Say hello</h2></div><div class=\"section-content prose\">\n<p class=\"intro\">A shared interest is enough to start.</p><p>A question, a different perspective, something you are making, or a specific collaboration idea: there is room for all of those here. A simple hello is welcome too.</p><p>Name, email, and message are required. Topic and context are optional. You do not need a company, a job title, or a pitch.</p>\n<noscript><p class=\"form-message\">This form needs JavaScript for its anti-spam check. Please enable JavaScript to send a message. The rest of the website works without it.</p></noscript>\n<p id=\"contact-initialization\" class=\"small-copy\" role=\"status\">The contact form is loading. If the fields stay unavailable, reload the page or try another browser. A content blocker may be preventing the form script from loading.</p>\n<form id=\"contact-form\" class=\"contact-form\" action=\"https://submit-form.com/uPlTgRTAR\" method=\"POST\" aria-describedby=\"contact-privacy\"><fieldset id=\"contact-fields\" disabled><legend class=\"visually-hidden\">Your message</legend><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"_honeypot\" class=\"honeypot\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<span id=\"report-task-brief\" data-feedback-path=\"/technology/task-brief/\" data-feedback-title=\"Build a clearer AI task brief.\" hidden></span><span id=\"report-ai-answer-review\" data-feedback-path=\"/technology/check-ai-answers/\" data-feedback-title=\"How to check an AI answer.\" hidden></span><span id=\"report-ai-time-savings\" data-feedback-path=\"/technology/ai-time-savings/\" data-feedback-title=\"Does AI actually save you time?\" hidden></span><span id=\"report-living-well-weekly-reset\" data-feedback-path=\"/living-well/weekly-reset/\" data-feedback-title=\"A weekly reset that does not become another job\" hidden></span><span id=\"report-poker-first-live-tournament\" data-feedback-path=\"/poker/first-live-tournament/\" data-feedback-title=\"Your first live tournament, without the guesswork.\" hidden></span><span id=\"report-poker-hand-rankings\" data-feedback-path=\"/poker/hand-rankings/\" data-feedback-title=\"Which hand wins?\" hidden></span>\n<p id=\"study-inquiry\" class=\"small-copy\" hidden><strong>Website usability study inquiry.</strong> The optional context field was filled with a fixed topic, not your answers. You may edit or clear it. Sending this form expresses interest only; it does not enroll you, authorize recording, or count as research consent. Please do not include task answers, private worksheets, or confidential information. Study details, notes, withdrawal, and deletion arrangements must be agreed separately before any session.</p",
          "old": "d568a8bc9322\" defer></script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/search-visibility.css?v=c5a767619d13\">\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"name\": \"Contact | Nolan Kido\", \"url\": \"https://nolankido.com/contact/\", \"description\": \"Write to Nolan Kido with a shared interest, a different perspective, a collaboration idea, or a simple hello. No pitch required.\", \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"WebSite\", \"@id\": \"https://nolankido.com/#website\", \"name\": \"Nolan Kido\", \"url\": \"https://nolankido.com/\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"https://nolankido.com/about/#nolan-kido\", \"name\": \"Nolan Kido\", \"url\": \"https://nolankido.com/about/\"}}, \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-05\", \"@id\": \"https://nolankido.com/contact/#webpage\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-US\", \"breadcrumb\": {\"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"@id\": \"https://nolankido.com/contact/#breadcrumb\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://nolankido.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Contact\", \"item\": \"https://nolankido.com/contact/\"}]}}</script>\n  <script defer src=\"https://cloud.umami.is/script.js\" data-website-id=\"51bfd4d7-08ac-4299-924b-621af60fa7f1\" data-domains=\"nolankido.com,www.nolankido.com\" data-do-not-track=\"true\" data-exclude-search=\"true\" data-exclude-hash=\"true\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"site-page page-contact\">\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <div class=\"site-bar\"><div class=\"shell\"><a href=\"/\">nolankido.com</a><span class=\"site-edition\">Practical AI · A life beyond the screen</span><nav class=\"utility-navigation\" aria-label=\"Site shortcuts\"><a class=\"utility-find\" href=\"/find/\">Search</a><a class=\"utility-writing\" href=\"/notes/\">Writing</a><a class=\"utility-start\" href=\"/start-here/\">Start here</